{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE PARTY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pine Hill is a quiet Midwestern college town. Quiet enough that nobody seemed to hear Ginny Nicholson die. Now it's up to you to converse with and find who her killer is at the next local house party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/extras/986265e414cc3f602f15f08dbb3c4b3a.avif?t=1757383005\" width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIT AND STAY A WHILE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embracing Midwestern nostalgia with a blend of the 80's and the early 2000's eras, explore the nuances of the\u00a0connections we have and the little things in life in traversing the memories of party attendees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/extras/4606b86e8799e544664540640b5198e4.poster.avif?t=1757383005\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/extras/4606b86e8799e544664540640b5198e4.webm?t=1757383005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PARTY FESTIVITIES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a cast of 15 characters, this game will include visual novel-like gameplay with the ability to explore and move around spaces.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in 15 minigames from bowling to taking photos to fighting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hundreds of dialogue options and 50+ scenes with locals, coworkers, and roommates.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882060?t=1757383005","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/6820da30ac9494498f75e471a5f5c1ce3b6236c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757383005","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/f782bfb48417b652b334558f334b5d238d8fdff2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757383005","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/f782bfb48417b652b334558f334b5d238d8fdff2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757383005","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains language, depictions of violence and self harm/suicide."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE PARTY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pine Hill is a quiet Midwestern college town. Quiet enough that nobody seemed to hear Ginny Nicholson die. Now it's up to you to converse with and find who her killer is at the next local house party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/extras/986265e414cc3f602f15f08dbb3c4b3a.avif?t=1757383005\" width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIT AND STAY A WHILE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embracing Midwestern nostalgia with a blend of the 80's and the early 2000's eras, explore the nuances of the\u00a0connections we have and the little things in life in traversing the memories of party attendees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882060/extras/4606b86e8799e544664540640b5198e4.poster.avif?t=1757383005\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st